            "text": "(1) ア　Cで離れるための初速度",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Oでの速さを \\(v_0\\)、Cでの速さを \\(v_C\\) とします。Cでは垂直抗力が0なので、重力だけが向心力になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{mv_C^2}{r}=mg\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad v_C=\\sqrt{gr}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "OとCの高さの差は \\(2r\\) です。床面を位置エネルギーの基準にして保存則を立てます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac12mv_0^2=\\frac12mv_C^2+mg(2r)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\boxed{v_0=\\sqrt{5gr}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "イ　CからOまでの水平距離",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Cでは速度が水平方向です。高さ \\(2r\\) から落ちる時間を鉛直運動で求め、その間の水平移動を計算します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2r=\\frac12gt^2\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad t=2\\sqrt{\\frac rg}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\mathrm{OA}=v_Ct=\\sqrt{gr}\\cdot2\\sqrt{\\frac rg}=\\boxed{2r}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "ウ・エ　AとBでの力",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "OA上では鉛直方向のつり合いから \\(N=mg\\) です。A通過直後は速さ \\(v_0\\) の円運動なので、中心向きを正にします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{mv_0^2}{r}=N_A-mg\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad N_A=6mg=\\boxed{6N}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "BはAより高さ \\(r\\) にあります。まず保存則で速さを求め、その速さから遠心力の大きさを出します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac12mv_0^2=\\frac12mv_B^2+mgr\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad v_B=\\sqrt{3gr}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{mv_B^2}{r}=3mg=\\boxed{3N}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "オ　半球から離れる高さ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "頂点Dから中心角 \\(\\theta\\) だけ進んだ点Eを考えます。Eの床からの高さは \\(R\\cos\\theta\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "mgR=\\frac12mv_E^2+mgR\\cos\\theta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "離れる瞬間は垂直抗力が0です。向心方向の重力成分だけが向心力になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{mv_E^2}{R}=mg\\cos\\theta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos\\theta=\\frac23\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\boxed{R\\cos\\theta=\\frac23R}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a-fig-hemisphere-detach",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) カ・キ　2惑星の周期と速さ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "惑星A、Bの軌道半径は \\(R\\)、\\(4R\\) です。ケプラーの第三法則 \\(T^2\\propto r^3\\) を比で使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{T_A^2}{R^3}=\\frac{T_B^2}{(4R)^3}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\boxed{\\frac{T_B}{T_A}=8}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "惑星Aの速さは、恒星から受ける万有引力を向心力として求めます。惑星Aの質量は両辺から消えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{mv_A^2}{R}=G\\frac{Mm}{R^2}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\boxed{v_A=\\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{R}}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅱ問　一様電場中の運動と導体球殻（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "ア \\(1.7\\)／イ \\(2.0\\)／ウ \\(4.5\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "エ \\(k\\dfrac{Q}{r^{2}}\\)／オ \\(0\\)／カ \\(\\dfrac{v_0{}^{2}}{2A}\\)／キ \\(\\sqrt{2AR}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "まずここを確認",
            "text": "正電荷の位置エネルギーは \\(qV\\) です。速度はエネルギー保存で、時間は電位グラフの傾きから電場と加速度を求めて区間ごとに計算します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) ア・イ　速度",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原点から最初の1.00 Vの山を越えるため、初期運動エネルギーは少なくとも \\(q\\times1.00\\) 必要です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac12mv_1^2=q\\cdot1.00\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad v_1=\\sqrt3=1.73\\simeq\\boxed{1.7\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}]}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "初速度2.00 m/sのとき、\\(x=6.00\\,\\mathrm m\\) では電位が原点と同じ0 Vです。したがって速さも初めと同じです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac12m(2.00)^2=\\frac12mv_2^2\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\boxed{v_2=2.0\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}]}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "ウ　原点から6.00 mまでの時間",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "グラフを0〜1.50 m、1.50〜3.00 m、3.00〜6.00 mの3区間に分けます。電場は電位の傾きの負号なので、各区間の加速度は次の通りです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "E_1=-1.00,\\quad E_2=0,\\quad E_3=\\frac13\\quad[\\mathrm{V/m}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_1=-1.00,\\quad a_2=0,\\quad a_3=0.500\\quad[\\mathrm{m/s^2}]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "区間端の速さは順に2.00、1.00、1.00、2.00 m/sです。等加速度運動では速度変化を加速度で割り、等速区間では距離を速さで割ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\Delta t_1=1.00\\,\\mathrm s,\\qquad \\Delta t_2=1.50\\,\\mathrm s,\\qquad \\Delta t_3=2.00\\,\\mathrm s",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\boxed{t=\\Delta t_1+\\Delta t_2+\\Delta t_3=4.5\\,[\\mathrm s]}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "つまずきやすい点",
            "text": "電場は \\(E=-\\Delta V/\\Delta x\\) です。電位グラフの傾きと電場の符号を同じにしないでください。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) エ・オ　導体球殻の電場",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "球殻の外側では、中心にある全電荷 \\(Q\\) が作る電場と同じです。球対称なのでガウスの法則を使えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\boxed{E(r)=k\\frac{Q}{r^2}\\quad(R<r)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "導体内部では静電平衡の電場は0です。内面に \\(-Q\\)、外面に \\(+Q\\) が誘導され、導体中の電場を打ち消します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\boxed{E(r)=0\\quad(r_1<r<R)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "カ　点電荷が戻る高さ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "負電荷 \\(-q\\) の位置エネルギーは \\(-kqQ/r\\) です。表面から高さ \\(h\\) まで進み、速さが0になったとしてエネルギー保存を立てます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac12mv_0^2-\\frac{kqQ}{R}=-\\frac{kqQ}{R+h}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "問題文の \\(h\\ll R\\) の近似を右辺へ使い、\\(A=kqQ/(mR^2)\\) で整理します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\boxed{h=\\frac{mR^2v_0^2}{2kqQ}=\\frac{v_0^2}{2A}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "キ　無限遠へ到達する最小初速度",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "ちょうど無限遠へ届く境界では、無限遠での速さも位置エネルギーも0です。表面での力学的エネルギーが0以上となる条件を立てます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac12mv_0^2-\\frac{kqQ}{R}\\ge0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\boxed{v_0\\ge\\sqrt{\\frac{2kqQ}{mR}}=\\sqrt{2AR}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅲ問　熱力学サイクル（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "ア \\(\\dfrac{633}{64}\\)／イ \\(\\dfrac{633}{64}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "ウ \\(\\dfrac{27}{8}\\)／エ \\(\\dfrac{405}{64}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "オ \\(\\dfrac{95}{16}\\)／カ \\(\\dfrac{253}{633}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "まずここを確認",
            "text": "A→Bは等積、B→Cは断熱、C→Aは等圧です。気体が外部へする仕事を正として、熱力学第一法則を \\(Q=\\Delta U+W\\) と書きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) ア・イ　等積過程A→B",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "単原子分子理想気体1 molの内部エネルギーは \\(U=3PV/2\\) です。等積過程では仕事が0なので、吸収熱は内部エネルギー変化と同じです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\Delta U_{AB}=\\frac32(P_2-P_1)V_1=\\frac32\\left(\\frac{243}{32}-1\\right)P_1V_1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\boxed{Q_{AB}=\\Delta U_{AB}=\\frac{633}{64}P_1V_1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) ウ・エ　断熱過程B→C",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "単原子分子理想気体の比熱比は \\(5/3\\) です。断熱変化なのでポアソンの法則をBとCへ適用します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P_2V_1^{5/3}=P_1V_2^{5/3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{V_2}{V_1}=\\left(\\frac{P_2}{P_1}\\right)^{3/5}=\\left(\\frac{243}{32}\\right)^{3/5}=\\boxed{\\frac{27}{8}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "断熱過程では \\(Q_{BC}=0\\) なので、気体が外部へする仕事は内部エネルギーの減少分です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "W_{BC}=\\frac32(P_2V_1-P_1V_2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\boxed{W_{BC}=\\frac32\\left(\\frac{243}{32}-\\frac{27}{8}\\right)P_1V_1=\\frac{405}{64}P_1V_1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) オ・カ　放出熱と熱効率",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "C→Aでは体積が減るので、気体が外部へする仕事は負です。熱量も負になり、その絶対値が放出熱の大きさです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q_{CA}=\\frac32P_1(V_1-V_2)+P_1(V_1-V_2)=\\frac52P_1(V_1-V_2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q_{CA}=-\\frac{95}{16}P_1V_1\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\boxed{|Q_{CA}|=\\frac{95}{16}P_1V_1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\boxed{e=1-\\frac{|Q_{CA}|}{Q_{AB}}=1-\\frac{95/16}{633/64}=\\frac{253}{633}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "nippon-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "講評を学習計画へつなげる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "structured_list",
            "style": "facts",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "第Ⅰ問",
                "text": "円運動では垂直抗力0の離脱条件とエネルギー保存をセットで練習する。惑星の2欄は典型公式で確実に取る。"
              },
              {
                "label": "第Ⅱ問",
                "text": "電位グラフは、速度をエネルギー保存、時間を電場・加速度へ分ける。導体球殻は導体内部の電場0を最初に固定する。"
              },
              {
                "label": "第Ⅲ問",
                "text": "各過程に等積・断熱・等圧の名前を書き、\\(Q=\\Delta U+W\\) の符号を統一してから既約分数を整理する。"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "時間配分",
            "text": "基本事項が多い一方、電位グラフの時間計算と熱サイクルの分数計算は長くなります。第Ⅰ問(2)、第Ⅱ問(1)の速度、第Ⅲ問(1)など短い答案を先に確保してください。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
